{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2023-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1689465600, "end_date": 1690156799, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:22:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "142656239", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062093420", "personaname": "Rosethorn Larana'Khash", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198062093420/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 78, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 78, "last_played": 1690133513, "avatar": "86e9204322cc401161094f5e7452f92479ef89d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Movement feels bad. Controls feel bad. Game seems badly programmed, has weird issues I can't even describe.", "timestamp_created": 1690133759, "timestamp_updated": 1690133759, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.446007609367370605", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142645731", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020569126", "personaname": "Ann", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Retl/", "num_games_owned": 797, "num_reviews": 122, "playtime_forever": 149, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 149, "last_played": 1642810745, "avatar": "eea87fe79a30c81717c7c032b571f65e3396f45a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Chris Christodoulou is a hyper asshat and I will never, ever support anything with him in the credits going forward. This includes this game. I'd refund it if I could, and I'm sorry to all of the other people who put their honest hard work into this.\n\n(Unlike the sequel, I never liked this game much and if there are improvement mods, I couldn't find them. It's a slow paced sci-fi rouge lite. The action elements are not the focus here. This game is getting a remake, you may be better of waiting for that version. It'll still have Chris's music in it though, so honestly I'd suggest not to buy literally anything in this series. You can do better for the price range. )", "timestamp_created": 1690121619, "timestamp_updated": 1690121619, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.425951510667800903", "comment_count": 9, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142595473", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130556499", "personaname": "Ashiepeace", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ashiepeace/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 21274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21270, "last_played": 1699472130, "avatar": "09d674ffda70b4e602e74166f96a1cfe1f3ec1e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's been a long time since i've played this game, but looking back I still have great memories of it-- getting absolutely crazy and broken runs, listening to the awesome soundtrack, and maybe abusing a few glitches here and there ;). I think this game really stands for itself as a classic.", "timestamp_created": 1690046752, "timestamp_updated": 1690046752, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142542696", "author": {"steamid": "76561199112373726", "personaname": "docker-compose", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199112373726/", "num_games_owned": 1